# Copy to .dev.vars (repo root) for `npx wrangler dev`. Never commit .dev.vars.
# Your real measurement ID (GA4 Admin -> Data streams) overrides the placeholder in wrangler.jsonc;
# with GA_DEBUG=true the hits show up in GA4 Admin -> DebugView. No API secret is needed.
# GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=G-XXXXXXXXXX
